[4.243179, "o", "                   [--yolo] [--ralph N] [--architect] [--editor-provider NAME]\r\n                   [--editor-model SLUG] [--no-auto-commit] [--print GOAL]\r\n                   [--json] [--theme THEME]\r\n                   [path]\r\n--\r\n  --yolo, -y            Unattended mode: auto-approve every `ask` permission\r\n                        for the session so CI scripts don't stall on prompts.\r\n--\r\n                        mid-session with `/yolo`.\r\n  --ralph N             Bounded iterate-until-green Ralph Loop. Re-seed the\r\n--\r\n                        useful in ``--print`` runs.\r\n  --architect           Phase 71.2 architect/editor two-model split. Each\r\n--\r\n  --print GOAL, -p GOAL\r\n                        Non-interactive print mode. Run the autonomous loop to\r\n"]
