[46.35891, "o", "\r\nThe `cli-demo` charm is a minimal, barebones Juju charm built for Ubuntu 24.04. It currently contains no operational logic, event handlers, integrations, or configuration, serving purely as an empty structural scaffolding.\r\n"]
